WEBVTT

00:02:29.312 --> 00:02:33.191
The police are outside my door,

00:02:33.191 --> 00:02:39.197
but I'm clutching your hair doll
I made on the floor.

00:02:40.239 --> 00:02:45.453
If they ever tell people how often
other people look at their profiles,

00:02:45.453 --> 00:02:47.121
I will kill myself.

00:02:47.121 --> 00:02:49.123
(Laughter)

00:02:50.499 --> 00:02:54.253
So goodbye,

00:02:54.253 --> 00:02:57.965
lover I stalked.

00:02:58.716 --> 00:03:00.468
(Applause)